DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
9299::$$$message_0069_0000_0000$$$::I spend time absentmindedly in the student council room.::
9300::$$$message_0069_0001_0000$$$::"...Hm. Gold moves to 82 and captures the bishop.[lr]::
9301::$$$message_0069_0001_0001$$$::Wait, would this be two extra moves...?"[lr]::
9302::$$$message_0069_0001_0002$$$::Issei must not have any work either, as he's enjoying an old magazine of shogi puzzles.::
9303::$$$message_0069_0002_0000$$$::It would be good if there was a shogi board and pieces, but there's no such equipment in the student council room. It's Issei's policy to try not to bring in recreational goods at all because it would set a bad example. [lr]::
9304::$$$message_0069_0002_0001$$$::I've also been enjoying the crossword puzzle published by the newspaper club, "A Hundred Battles from Taiga Fujimura's Past," but it's more bleak than fun because of its genre.::
9305::$$$message_0069_0003_0000$$$::"Mrgh, can't this knight get out of the way? It's an eyesore... [cacheimage storage=一成01d(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=一成01d(中)]Ugh, give me some tea, Emiya! Make it hot enough to make my brain tingle, will you?"[lr]::
9306::$$$message_0069_0003_0001$$$::"All right. Oh, there's some red bean jelly left, do you want some?"[lr]::
9307::$$$message_0069_0003_0002$$$::"Hm. That's a tempting suggestion, but I shall wait till my break at three. I must maintain a regular routine with snacks."::
9308::$$$message_0069_0004_0000$$$::Apparently right now isn't his break time.[lr]::
9309::$$$message_0069_0004_0001$$$::Thirty more minutes until three.[lr]::
9310::$$$message_0069_0004_0002$$$::It must be the quota that he has imposed on himself, as he seems to have the intention to solve the third question of the advanced shogi puzzles.::
9311::$$$message_0069_0005_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
9312::$$$message_0069_0005_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
9313::$$$message_0069_0005_0002$$$::We both immerse ourselves in our own ways of killing time.[lr]::
9314::$$$message_0069_0005_0003$$$::When the 4 PM bell rings, Issei nods and locks the safe. ::
9315::$$$message_0069_0006_0000$$$::"Hm? What was that, Issei?"[lr]::
9316::$$$message_0069_0006_0001$$$::"This? It's the report of what kind of projects there will be at the cultural festival. It's divided by class and club."[lr]::
9317::$$$message_0069_0006_0002$$$::"Oh, okay... So, why do you put that in a safe? To keep robbers away?"::
9318::$$$message_0069_0007_0000$$$::"Something similar to that. As a matter of fact, the deadline to report projects for the cultural festival is today at 4 PM. We won't accept any reports after that no matter what the reason is.[lr]::
9319::$$$message_0069_0007_0001$$$::Therefore, any classes or clubs that have not decided their project for the cultural festival at this point cannot participate in this year's cultural festival."[lr]::
9320::$$$message_0069_0007_0002$$$::"I see. So, 4 PM was the deadline."::
9321::$$$message_0069_0008_0000$$$::"Yes. That's why we were staying in the student council room, even though it's the weekend.[lr]::
9322::$$$message_0069_0008_0001$$$::So that's the reason, Emiya. We have finished today's duties. Why don't we go get some sweets at Shinto on the way home?"::
9323::$$$message_0069_0009_0000$$$::Issei happily gets ready to leave.[lr]::
9324::$$$message_0069_0009_0001$$$::"Obanyaki again? You like it too, huh?"[lr]::
9325::$$$message_0069_0009_0002$$$::Of course I love it too, so I gladly get up from my seat.::
9326::$$$message_0069_0010_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
9327::$$$message_0069_0010_0001$$$::But cultural festival projects, huh... I wonder which club hasn't decided yet...?::
909300::$$$message_9069_0001_0000$$$::"...Hm. Gold moves to 82 and captures the bishop."[r]::

